  "result": "All 44 tests pass! I've added two new functions to `src/invoices.js`:\n\n**addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })** \u2014 Adds a line to a draft invoice or increases qty if that SKU already exists:\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with the line added at the end (or qty increased)\n- Validates qty and SKU like createInvoice\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Returns `QTY_INVALID` or `UNKNOWN_SKU` as appropriate\n- Never mutates the input\n\n**removeLine(invoice, sku)** \u2014 Removes a line from a draft invoice:\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` without that line\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Returns `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Returns `NO_LINES` if it would remove the last line (invoices must have at least one line)\n- Never mutates the input\n\nAdded two error codes to `src/errors.js`:\n- `NOT_DRAFT` \u2014 Can only modify a draft invoice\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND` \u2014 No line with that SKU on the invoice\n\nAdded 13 new tests covering:\n- Adding new lines and increasing existing line quantities\n- Draft status enforcement on both functions\n- All error conditions\n- Immutability (no mutation of input)\n- Integration (chaining addLine and removeLine operations)",
